const html = "\n<div class=\"photo photo-tall\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo to come: Kids playing, or the property\"><span class=\"photo-tag\">Photo</span><span>Kids playing, or the property</span></div>\n<section class=\"card card-center\">\n  <h2 class=\"h2\">The Story</h2>\n  <div class=\"prose\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">North Kitsap United (NKU) is a YMCA-centered sports, recreation, and well-being campus at the intersection of Bond Road and Stottlemeyer Road in North Kitsap County. NKU is a project of YMCA of Pierce and Kitsap Counties, and Kingston North Kitsap Rotary Club.</p>\n    <p class=\"p\">When fully-built, the 100-acre campus will feature as many as eight multi-use fields - both turf and grass - pickle ball, tennis, and basketball courts, disc golf course, dog park, ADA-accessible youth playground, and a full-scale YMCA, with access to nearby outdoor trails and hiking. The campus will be owned and operated by the Y. It will be built by Cal Ripken Sr. Foundation’s general contracting and construction team.</p>\n    <div class=\"grid2\"><div class=\"photo\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo to come: Youth sports in North Kitsap\"><span class=\"photo-tag\">Photo</span><span>Youth sports in North Kitsap</span></div><div class=\"photo\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo to come: Families and community\"><span class=\"photo-tag\">Photo</span><span>Families and community</span></div></div>\n    <p class=\"p\">The North Kitsap United Campus is an up-stream investment in youth well-being: a community third place where children, youth, and families build connection, physical health, and belonging. With the staging of regional tournaments, it also becomes an economic driver benefitting local shops, restaurants, and hotels.</p>\n    <p class=\"p\">After years of exploring alternatives, NKU will become a reality with the land purchase by the Y from Raydient Places and Properties in late 2026. The $1.5M purchase coincides with Raydient selling 300-acres adjacent to the NKU site to the Greater Peninsula Conservancy (GPC).</p>\n    <div class=\"photo\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo to come: The land: aerial or ground view of the site\"><span class=\"photo-tag\">Photo</span><span>The land: aerial or ground view of the site</span></div>\n    <p class=\"p\">Kingston North Kitsap Rotary is responsible for raising the $25m necessary - fundraising is underway - to build the fields and courts. West Sound Disc Golf Association (WSDGA) will build the disc golf course. The Y will be responsible for its facility. A $1M anonymous endowment by a Kingston resident will provide support for continuing maintenance of the fields and courts.</p>\n    <p class=\"p\">A turning point, eliminating all doubt about project feasibility, occurred Oct 11, 2026, when the Y and Rotary held a campaign kickoff. At the event the Port Gamble S’Klallam Tribe announced a $1M pledge, to be contributed over five years. Chris Tom, Vice Chair of the Tribal Council, said “Our support of North Kitsap United reflects our belief that environmental stewardship and responsible community development can work together to create a healthier, more vibrant future for everyone in North Kitsap.” More than $3.5m was raised for NKU at the event, including pledges by Greater Kingston Kiwanis, Kingston North Kitsap Rotary Club, and Kingston Youth Sports Association. Following the gala, fundraising totaled $8.5M toward the $25M goal.</p>\n    <p class=\"lead\">NKU. Creating Lasting Impact. Join the Team.</p>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"/donate\">Donate</a>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"card\">\n  <h2 class=\"h2\">Where It Is</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid2\">\n    <div class=\"figure\">\n      <a class=\"img-link\" href=\"/images/site/location-map.jpg\"><img class=\"img-full\" src=\"/images/site/location-map.jpg\" alt=\"Location map: the NKU site on SR 307 (Bond Road) at Stottlemeyer Road, with arrows toward Port Gamble, Kingston, Hansville and Poulsbo\"></a>\n      <h3 class=\"h3\">Location</h3>\n      <p class=\"p\">[Caption to come.]</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"figure\">\n      <a class=\"img-link\" href=\"/images/site/site-plan.jpg\"><img class=\"img-full\" src=\"/images/site/site-plan.jpg\" alt=\"Site map of the NKU campus: YMCA, sports fields, outdoor courts, disc golf in the natural area, dog park, ADA playground, community garden, parking, trails and wildlife corridor, next to Port Gamble Forest Heritage Park\"></a>\n      <h3 class=\"h3\">Site plan</h3>\n      <p class=\"p\">[Caption to come.]</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"note\" style=\"text-align:center\">Click either map to see it full size.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"card\">\n  <h2 class=\"h2\">News / Updates</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid2\">\n    <div class=\"photo\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo to come: Article photo\"><span class=\"photo-tag\">Photo</span><span>Article photo</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sub-card\"><span class=\"tl-date\">[Date]</span><h3 class=\"h3\">[Headline]</h3><p class=\"p\">[Article, condensed, with photo.]</p></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"btn-row\"><a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"/donate\">Donate</a></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"card\" id=\"campaign\" data-nku-campaign>\n  <div class=\"split\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color:#8b6914\">The Campaign</span><h2 class=\"h2\">Overview</h2></div>\n    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://nku-tracker.com\">Open full dashboard on nku-tracker.com →</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stat-grid\">\n    <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Pledged</span><span class=\"stat-value\" data-stat=\"pledged\">—</span></div>\n    <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Received to date</span><span class=\"stat-value\" data-stat=\"received\">—</span></div>\n    <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Estimated cost</span><span class=\"stat-value\" data-stat=\"estimatedCost\">—</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"stat-label\">Progress toward estimated cost</span>\n  <div class=\"bar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Campaign progress toward the estimated cost\" data-bar-label>\n    <div class=\"bar-received\" data-bar=\"received\" style=\"width:0%\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bar-pledged\" data-bar=\"pledged\" style=\"width:0%\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"legend-row\">\n    <span class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"swatch swatch-received\"></span>Received <span data-stat=\"received\">—</span></span>\n    <span class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"swatch swatch-pledged\"></span>Pledged <span data-stat=\"pledged\">—</span></span>\n    <span class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"swatch swatch-cost\"></span>Estimated cost <span data-stat=\"estimatedCost\">—</span></span>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"note\" data-stat=\"asOf\"></p>\n</section>\n<div class=\"btn-row\"><a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"/donate\">Donate</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/get-involved\">Get Involved</a></div>\n";
---
